flowchart TB
  input[Validated report + optional ACK metadata] --> queue[Private outbox envelope]
  queue --> post[flush / PID lock / POST]
  post --> accepted{Accepted and same report ID?}
  accepted -- yes --> ack{All supplied ACKs succeed?}
  ack -- yes --> deleted[Delete original / retry / manifest]
  ack -- no --> kept[Keep original bytes + retry metadata]
  accepted -- timeout or recoverable rejection --> kept
  accepted -- ordinary permanent rejection --> dead[Dead-letter retains original]
  post -- ordinary v9 413 --> split[Fixed manifest + fragment retry]
  split -- complete ID and hash --> ack
  split -- partial / unknown / invalid --> kept
  kept -- retry time reached --> post
  queue -- v5-v8 age over 30d --> dead
  queue -- controlled one-shot budget unavailable --> held[Private held-outbox / no auto retry]
  post -- controlled failure --> held
  deleted --> receipt[Runner receipt only after whole flush success]
